{
  "id": 8837122195655,
  "title": "Custom Wolf Head Centered in Dreamcatcher Quilt",
  "handle": "custom-wolf-head-centered-in-dreamcatcher-comforter-be6b37a3e1-be6b37a3e1",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the spirit of the wild and bring cozy warmth to your bedroom with the Customized Native Wolf Quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a beautifully designed Native American inspired theme, this quilt showcases a stunning wolf head centered in a dreamcatcher with elegant feathers. Perfect for wrapping yourself up while reading a book on the sofa, relaxing on the couch, or adding a unique western style to your bedding set.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customized Design:</strong> Features a personalized option where you can customize your name or text to make it a truly unique gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Comfort:</strong> Made from a lightweight, breathable, and durable cotton-polyester blend that keeps you cool in the summer and warm in the winter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Native American Inspired Theme:</strong> Decorated with a vibrant, colorful native wolf design, feathers, and a dreamcatcher.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Ideal for indoor bed or sofa lounging, and durable enough for outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water for simple maintenance; dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes as a Quilt with the option to include 2 matching pillowcases to complete your bedding set.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Native Wolf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Western</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Native American inspired</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt, 2 pillow covers (optional)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
